msgid "Update"
msgstr "Update"

msgid ""
"Today, we released Quarkus 3.24.\n"
"It comes with major version upgrades to major components and a brand new feature: the Dev Assistant."
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/47756[#47756] - Introduce the Assistant"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/41310[#41310] - Upgrade to Hibernate ORM 7.0, Hibernate Reactive 3.0, and Hibernate Search 8.0"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/42292[#42292] - Upgrade to Hibernate Validator 9.0"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/47108[#47108] - Upgrade to Kafka Client 4.0"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/47830[#47830] - Add OIDC Health Check"
msgstr ""

msgid "To update to Quarkus 3.24, we recommend updating to the latest version of the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Note that `quarkus update` can update your applications from any version of Quarkus (including 2.x) to Quarkus 3.24."
msgstr ""

msgid "For more information about the adjustments you need to make to your applications, please refer to the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.24[Quarkus 3.24 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Dev Assistant"
msgstr "Dev Assistant"

msgid "We all love Quarkus' Dev UI and Quarkus 3.24 paves the way for major improvements to the Dev UI through a brand new feature: the Dev Assistant."
msgstr ""

msgid "The Assistant is a new extension point to provide features assisting you in your daily coding:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Generate clients from your OpenAPI specification"
msgstr ""

msgid "Generate additional test data"
msgstr ""

msgid "... sky is the limit!"
msgstr ""

msgid "The Assistant can offer features that are backed by AI, but isn't limited to it."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We have been cooking an extension leveraging the Assistant feature for a while: https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-chappie[Quarkus Chappie].\n"
"You can already add it to your projects."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"But don't see it as the end of things:\n"
"you can develop your own Assistant features in your extensions."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hibernate ORM"
msgstr "Hibernate ORM"

msgid "Hibernate ORM was updated to https://hibernate.org/orm/releases/7.0/[7.0]."
msgstr ""

msgid "This is a major version and it comes with new features and significant changes that are presented in more details in a https://quarkus.io/blog/hibernate7-on-quarkus/[dedicated blog post]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Please also have a look to the dedicated section of our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.24#jakarta-persistence-hibernate-orm[migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hibernate ORM 7.0 is an implementation of https://jakarta.ee/specifications/persistence/3.2/[Jakarta Persistence 3.2]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hibernate Reactive"
msgstr "Hibernate Reactive"

msgid "Hibernate Validator was updated to https://hibernate.org/reactive/releases/3.0/[3.0]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hibernate Search"
msgstr "Hibernate Search"

msgid "Hibernate Search was updated to https://hibernate.org/search/releases/8.0/[8.0]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hibernate Validator"
msgstr "Hibernate Validator"

msgid "Hibernate Validator was updated to https://hibernate.org/validator/releases/9.0/[9.0]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hibernate Validator 9.0 is an implementation of https://jakarta.ee/specifications/bean-validation/3.1/[Jakarta Validation 3.1]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Kafka Client"
msgstr "Kafkaクライアント"

msgid "The Kafka Client has been updated to 4.0."
msgstr ""

msgid "OIDC health check"
msgstr ""

msgid "Quarkus 3.24 offers a health check for OIDC that allows to check your Quarkus application is able to connect to your OIDC server."
msgstr ""

msgid "Platform component upgrades"
msgstr "プラットフォームコンポーネントのアップグレード"

msgid "Camel Quarkus"
msgstr ""

msgid "Camel Quarkus has been upgraded to 3.24.0."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr "完全な変更履歴"

msgid "You can get the full changelog of https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.24.0.CR1[3.24.0.CR1], https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.24.0[3.24.0], and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.24.1[3.24.1] on GitHub."
msgstr ""

msgid "Contributors"
msgstr "コントリビューター"

msgid ""
"The Quarkus community is growing and has now https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/graphs/contributors[1092 contributors].\n"
"Many many thanks to each and everyone of them."
msgstr ""

msgid "In particular for the 3.24 release, thanks to Alexandre Dutra, Alexey Loubyansky, appiepollo14, Ashish Ranjan, Bill Burke, Bruno Baptista, Clement Escoffier, David M. Lloyd, Davide D'Alto, Erik Mattheis, Foivos Zakkak, Fouad Almalki, gbourant, George Gastaldi, Georgios Andrianakis, Guillaume Smet, Holly Cummins, Inaki Villar, João Lopes, Julien Ponge, Katia Aresti, Kevin Wooten, Ladislav Thon, Lars, Lukas Schmitt, Marc Nuri, Marco Belladelli, marko-bekhta, Martin Bartoš, Martin Kouba, Martin Panzer, Matej Novotny, melloware, Michael Edgar, Michal Maléř, Michal Vavřík, Nicholas Hassan, nort3x, Ozan Gunalp, patriot1burke, Peter Palaga, Phillip Krüger, Robert Stupp, Roberto Cortez, Rostislav Svoboda, Sebastian Vogl, Sergey Beryozkin, Stefan Schmöller, Steve Hawkins, Stuart Douglas, Stéphane Épardaud, Teymur Babayev, Tim van der Lippe, Vincent Potucek, Volodymyr, xstefank, Yahya Berbeche, and Yoann Rodière."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "参加のお誘い"

msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "私達は皆様からのフィードバックに重きを置いています。バグ報告、改善要望を是非お願いします。一緒に素晴らしいものを作り上げていきましょう!"

msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "Quarkusユーザーの場合でも、単に興味を持っているだけの場合でも、恥ずかしがらずにコミュニティに参加して下さい!:"

msgid "provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub] でフィードバック"

msgid "craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr "コードを作成し、 https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[プルリクエスト] を送信"

msgid "discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr "https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] や https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[メーリングリスト] でディスカッションに参加"

msgid "ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow] で質問"
